	abstract = {Campus bike path planning is an important part of campus planning. Reasonable planning not only needs to meet the requirements of bicycle traffic on campus, but also should be coordinated with the whole campus system. Campus bike path planning index system was built based on engineering system theory. The objective TOPSIS evaluation method was applied to evaluate the campus bike path planning schemes. TOPSIS method was combined with evaluation index system to evaluate a specific case. The result shows that the combination of TOPSIS method and the established evaluation index system can objectively judge the advantages and disadvantages of bike path plans.},
